abstract: Zero-trust security and governance framework for autonomous multi-agent AI networks.
  Implements the CSA Agentic Trust Framework to mitigate OWASP Top 10 Agentic Risks using
  SPIFFE/SPIRE identities, OPA/Rego policy-as-code, and semantic guardrail gateways.
